    "text": "We get same range for angle of projections <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mn>90</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> . <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"norm